// Port-only (HD weather): the composite (composite.pshader) under neither rain nor falling snow: built without the
// rain's wet look and the weather's veil (the rain's or the snow's), which leave a colour as it is without them, so
// its pixels don't pay for the registers their reads take. MCVulkanPresenter draws with it whenever neither shows.

#define COMPOSITE_RAIN 0
#include "composite.pshader"
